24:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed","children":"Astronomical solar coordinates are subject to atmospheric temperature gradients, elevation differences, and horizon obstructions. In accordance with established classical Fiqh principles of religious precaution (*Ihtiyat*), worshippers are strongly advised to apply a 2 to 3 minute safety buffer before fast-breaking (*Iftar*) and prayer commencement."}]
